description:
Low-Rebound Memory Foam: sleep eye mask made of smooth cooling silk fabric lining and premium 6-layer low rebound high-quality memory foam, which is comfortable and breathable and shading extremely well;
3D Contoured Design: The sleeping mask unique contoured feature a protective curve with more contour space than another,coverage and the edges fit the cheekbones will not touch your eyelids and eye makeup, no pressure on your eyeballs, and you can open your eyes freely;
Adjustable Elastic Strap: Adjustable elastic band makes the sleeping blindfold fit all size heads, which will not catch or break hair nor will it hurt your ears, suitable for any sleeping position and stay in the place;
Lash Aftercare Must Have:Lashes extension aftercare is essential to investment you have made in your beauty routine by ensuring your lashes are safe from rubbing,tossing, turning and imprints left by your pillow or sleeping style.3D sleep mask will increase lashes extension longevity, reducing the frequency of infill appointments;
Washable and Reusable: The eye covers are reusable and hand washable(hand wash with water below 40℃ /104℉),our 3D sleep mask is a great choice for Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, friends' birthdays or ordinary small gifts.
